        "text": "B Metaphorical examples of motion"
      },
      {
        "y": 337.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 433.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The maths lesson limped to a conclusion and everyone thankfully left the room."
      },
      {
        "y": 349.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 314.8,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Let’s hop off the bus at the next stop. [quickly get off]"
      },
      {
        "y": 361.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 405.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Miguel’s business staggered on for a few years and then finally collapsed."
      },
      {
        "y": 373.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 311.6,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Lisa did staggeringly well in her exams. [amazingly]"
      },
      {
        "y": 385.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 377.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "The government has lurched from one economic crisis to the next."
      },
      {
        "y": 397.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 410.4,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Maria takes everything that life throws at her in her stride. [takes … calmly]"
      },
      {
        "y": 409.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 387.7,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Parents and teachers should try not to trample on children’s dreams."
      },
      {
        "y": 421.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 403.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "If the Campbells don’t pay their bill this week, you’ll have to chase them."
      },
      {
        "y": 433.1,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 431.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "After several stumbling attempts at writing, Theo finally had a poem published."
      },
      {
        "y": 454.4,
        "x0": 75,
        "x1": 313.9,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "C People and water move in similar ways"
      },
      {
        "y": 471.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 336,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Crowds of tourists flowed across the square all day long."
      },
      {
        "y": 483.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 424.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "As soon as the school doors opened, children spilled out into the playground."
      },
      {
        "y": 495.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 425.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "People streamed into the lecture hall and soon there was standing room only."
      },
      {
        "y": 507.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 321.3,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "People have been pouring into the exhibition all day."
      },
      {
        "y": 519.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 413.1,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "A trickle of people appeared outside and by midday a crowd had gathered."
      },
      {
        "y": 531.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 406,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "We meandered round the town, window shopping to our hearts’ content."
      },
      {
        "y": 543.9,
        "x0": 99.2,
        "x1": 404.2,
        "tag": "main",
        "text": "Refugees have been flooding across the border since the start of the war."
      },
      {
        "y": 565.2,
        "x0": 74.4,
        "x1": 167.8,
        "tag": "main",
